UPDATE companies SET description='Topsy Products operates from Oshkosh, Wisconsin, where it functions as a custom design and fabrication shop focused on the off-road aftermarket. The company does not disclose a founding year, ownership structure, or founder names in its public materials.

The firm designs, engineers, and fabricates hardtop hoist systems, mounting brackets, and related accessories for Jeep Wrangler models (JL, JK, TJ/YJ), the Jeep Gladiator, and the Ford Bronco. It also produces radio communications accessories and a range of branded swag. All items are developed in-house, with the company emphasizing design engineering and development as core steps for every accessory it brings to market. No facility dimensions, headcount, annual volumes, or SKU counts are published.

The product lineup also serves users of radio communications gear through dedicated accessory brackets and mounts. Examples from the catalog include JL Hinge Hoist Brackets & Kits, JK Hinge Hoist Brackets & Kits, TJ/YJ Hoist Brackets & Kits, Gladiator Accessories, Door Storage, Ford Bronco Parts, and Radio Communications Accessories.

Topsy Products positions innovation as its guiding principle, stating that creative thinking and attention to detail are key to delivering each item to specification, on budget, and on time. The company frames its differentiation around an innovation-first mindset applied by its staff to every project.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom design", "Fabrication", "Design engineering", "Product development", "Hardtop hoist system manufacturing", "Bracket manufacturing", "Accessory manufacturing", "Radio communications accessory manufacturing"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Off-road vehicle accessories", "Radio communications accessories"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Innovation-first approach to every project", "In-house design engineering and development for all accessories", "Creative thinking and attention to detail emphasized", "Commitment to on-budget, on-time delivery"], "facts_used": ["Location: Oshkosh, Wisconsin -> db", "Business type: custom design and fabricator -> /", "Product lines: Jeep Wrangler (JL, JK, TJ/YJ), Gladiator, Ford Bronco hardtop hoist systems and brackets -> /", "Radio communications accessories offered -> /", "In-house design engineering and development stated -> /", "Innovation, creative thinking, attention to detail, on-budget/on-time claims -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Topy Products is an innovative custom design and fabricator. Every accessory we make requires in-depth design engineering and development.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='topsy-products' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Toray Plastics (America), Inc. is headquartered in North Kingstown, Rhode Island, with a second operation in Front Royal, Virginia housing its PEF Foam Division. No founders are named for the U.S. entity, which operates the Torayfan® and Lumirror® film divisions from its Rhode Island campus.

The manufacturer produces polypropylene and cast polypropylene films under the Torayfan® brand, polyester films under Lumirror®, and metallized OPP, PET, and bio-based PET films. Its PEF Division extrudes polyolefin, polypropylene, and polyethylene foams. Processes include extrusion coating, casting, metallizing, and hot stamping/cold foil. The company describes its equipment as state-of-the-art and says both divisions are global leaders in their respective markets, though facility size, headcount, and volumes are not disclosed.

Toray’s films and foams are sold to converters and manufacturers that fabricate finished goods for packaging, labels, solar-control window films, technical applications, housing and engineering, and automotive markets. The company does not name specific customers but notes its materials are used in food packaging, automotive interiors, and industrial applications.

Toray states its corporate philosophy is to contribute to society through the creation of new value with innovative ideas, technologies, and products, and it emphasizes environmental, social, and governance commitments. The group highlights a sustainability vision addressing climate change, water scarcity, and resource depletion, and holds certifications including ISO 9001, ISO 14001, BRC, Sedex, ISCC PLUS, and Rhode Island Green Manufacturing Certification.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001 (Quality Management Systems)','ISO 14001 (Environmental and Chemical Management Systems)','BRC (GFSI Product Quality and Safety Management Systems)','Sedex (Social Responsibility / Ethical Trade Audit)','IMS (FDA Milk Packaging)','ISCC PLUS Certificate (VA)','ISCC PLUS Certificate (RI)','Rhode Island Green Manufacturing Certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Extrusion coating", "Casting (polypropylene film)", "Metallizing (OPP, PET)", "Hot stamping / cold foil", "Bio-based PET film production", "Polyolefin foam extrusion", "Polypropylene foam extrusion", "Polyethylene foam extrusion"], "industries": ["Packaging", "Labels", "Solar control window", "Technical", "Housing & engineering", "Automotive"], "materials": ["Polypropylene", "Cast polypropylene", "Polyester", "Metallized OPP", "Metallized PET", "Bio-based PET", "Polyolefin foam", "Polypropylene foam", "Polyethylene foam"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["State-of-the-art equipment and global leadership in respective markets", "Corporate philosophy: contribute to society through creation of new value with innovative ideas, technologies, and products", "Wholly committed to environmental sustainability (climate change, water scarcity, resource depletion)", "Multiple certifications: ISO 9001, ISO 14001, BRC, Sedex, ISCC PLUS, Rhode Island Green Manufacturing Certification"], "facts_used": ["HQ in North Kingstown, RI -> /about-us", "Parent company Toray Industries estab