UPDATE companies SET description='Tri-Angle Metal Fab has operated from Milton, Vermont since its founding in 1972. The family-owned business began as a small workshop in the early 1970s and has grown into a modern, full-capacity manufacturing facility serving customers regionally and nationally.

The company specializes in custom sheet metal fabrication, CNC machined components, and NADCAP-certified fusion welding. Its capabilities span CNC programming (3- and 4-axis), turning, milling, drilling, powder coating, sand blasting, part assembly, and brazed assemblies. Tri-Angle handles everything from R&D prototypes and low-volume runs to full-scale production of high-tolerance, mission-critical components.

Tri-Angle serves the aerospace, defense, ordnance, electronics, and commercial sectors. Customers rely on the shop for aerospace-grade welds, multi-axis machined parts, and complex fabrications that meet stringent performance and compliance requirements.

The company emphasizes quality assurance through AS/ISO-certified systems, in-process inspections, and NADCAP welding standards. Its operating philosophy — “One Team, One Goal” — centers on collaborative partnerships, continual improvement via lean manufacturing and advanced process control, and a commitment to delivering parts on spec, on budget, and on schedule.', certifications=ARRAY['NADCAP','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom sheet metal fabrication", "CNC machining (milling, drilling, turning)", "CNC programming (3- and 4-axis)", "NADCAP-certified fusion welding", "Powder coating / finishing", "Sand blasting (small parts)", "Part assembly", "Brazed assemblies", "R&D prototyping", "Low-volume production", "Full-scale production", "Multi-axis machined parts", "High-tolerance component manufacturing", "In-process inspection"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Ordnance", "Electronics", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Lathes/CNC Turning Centers", "Sand Blasting (Small Parts)"], "volume": "R&D prototypes to full-scale production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["NADCAP-certified fusion welding", "AS/ISO-certified quality management systems", "Lean manufacturing and advanced process control", "Family-owned with over 50 years of experience", "Delivers parts on spec, on budget, and on schedule"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1972 -> db", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Headquarters Milton, Vermont -> /about-us", "Services: custom sheet metal fabrication, CNC machined components, NADCAP-certified fusion welding -> /about-us", "Industries: aerospace, defense, ordnance, electronics, commercial -> /about-us", "Certifications: NADCAP, ITAR -> db", "Facility: modern, full-capacity manufacturing facility -> /about-us", "Quality systems: AS/ISO-certified, in-process inspections, NADCAP welding standards -> /about-us", "Volume range: R&D prototypes to full-scale production -> /about-us", "Equipment: Lathes/CNC Turning Centers, San