UPDATE companies SET description='Triad Semiconductor, Inc. is headquartered in Winston-Salem, North Carolina. The company was launched more than two decades ago by founder Jim Kemerling, who serves as Chief Technology Officer, alongside CEO Lynn Hayden. It began by assembling a team of analog and mixed-signal engineers from semiconductor firms to create custom integrated circuits for real-world applications.

Triad designs high-performance custom ASICs (Application Specific Integrated Circuits) and develops Application Specific Standard Products (ASSPs). Its engineering focus spans analog and mixed-signal IC design for virtual and augmented reality, audio, automotive, medical, sensor, silicon photonics, and optical communication markets.

The firm''s Triad Micro Devices (TMD) line addresses aerospace and defense requirements, while its automotive-grade solutions meet ISO 26262 functional safety standards.

Triad emphasizes continuous quality improvement, holding ISO 9001:2015 certification and QML/MIL-PRF-38535 qualification. A UL-certified Functional Safety Professional on staff supports ISO 26262 compliance for automotive programs. The company states that its brand is built on quality, with prevention, detection, and corrective action driving internal and external processes.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','QML/MIL-PRF-38535','ISO 26262 UL Certified Functional Safety Professional (CFSP)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom ASIC design", "Mixed-signal IC design", "Application Specific Standard Product (ASSP) development", "Analog IC design", "Silicon photonics/optical communication IC design", "Functional safety certification (ISO 26262)", "MIL-PRF-38535 qualified manufacturing management", "Virtual reality/augmented reality IC solutions", "Audio IC design", "Automotive IC design", "Medical IC design", "Sensor IC design"], "industries": ["Aerospace & Defense", "Automotive", "Medical", "Consumer Electronics", "Virtual Reality / Augmented Reality", "Audio", "Sensors", "Silicon Photonics / Optical Communication", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["UL Certified Functional Safety Professional on staff", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management", "QML/MIL-PRF-38535 qualified for aerospace and defense", "ISO 26262 functional safety expertise for automotive", "Engineering team sourced from world-leading semiconductor companies"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Winston-Salem, North Carolina -> db", "Launched over twenty years ago -> /about-us", "Founder Jim Kemerling (CTO) and CEO Lynn Hayden -> /about-us", "Develops custom ASICs and ASSPs -> /", "Markets: VR/AR, Audio, Automotive, Medical, Sensors, Silicon Photonics/Optical Communication, Aerospace & Defense -> /about-us and /", "Triad Micro Devices (TMD) for Aerospace and Defense -> /about-us", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /qual