UPDATE companies SET description='Tribe Solar & Electric LLC operates from Newcastle, Oklahoma. The company was founded with a mission to provide affordable and sustainable energy solutions to the local community. Owner Fred Ridley leads the locally owned and operated business, which focuses on delivering quality solar installations across Oklahoma.

The firm provides residential and commercial solar installation services, including roof-mounted and ground-mounted systems, energy storage and standby power solutions, and a detach-and-reset service for roofers and contractors. It also offers Solar 911, a repair service for systems that are not performing or failing inspections. The company handles projects from design through completion.

Tribe Solar serves homeowners and businesses throughout Oklahoma, helping them reduce energy costs and increase energy independence.

