UPDATE companies SET description='Triton Roofing & Solar operates its Solar Division from Colorado Springs, Colorado, where the company was founded in 2006. The business is veteran-owned and locally owned, serving the Pikes Peak region with photovoltaic installation and related services.

The company provides solar panel installation, repair, maintenance, and replacement for both residential and commercial customers. It also offers commercial-scale solar systems, battery energy storage installations, and roofing services through its Roofing Division. To date, the firm has completed more than 350 solar projects and cites over 20 years of combined experience among its staff.

Triton serves homeowners and businesses across El Paso, Teller, Douglas, Elbert, Pueblo, and Fremont counties. Its commercial clients include companies seeking to reduce utility costs through custom solar arrays, while residential customers range from local homeowners to out-of-state property owners managing rentals remotely.

The company distinguishes itself as the only NABCEP PV Design Specialists in El Paso County and a COSSA member. It backs installations with a 10-year workmanship warranty and uses equipment from brands such as Enphase, Silfab, Q. Cells, REC, IronRidge, and S-5!. The firm emphasizes that its veteran-owned, locally rooted structure drives accountability and customer service.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP Certified','NABCEP PV Design Specialist']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation", "Solar panel repair", "Solar panel maintenance", "Solar panel replacement", "Commercial solar system design and installation", "Battery energy storage installation", "Roofing installation, inspection, repair, and replacement", "NABCEP PV design services"], "industries": ["Renewable energy", "Solar energy", "Commercial solar", "Residential solar", "Energy storage"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Enphase", "Silfab", "Q. Cells", "REC", "IronRidge", "S-5!"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Only NABCEP PV Design Specialists in El Paso County", "COSSA member", "10-year workmanship warranty on installations", "Uses industry-leading equipment brands (Enphase, Silfab, Q. Cells, REC, IronRidge, S-5!)", "Veteran-owned and locally operated"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2006 -> db", "Headquarters Colorado Springs, Colorado -> db, /, /about-us", "Veteran-owned -> db, /, /about-us, /services", "Locally owned -> /, /about-us, /services", "NABCEP-certified solar company -> /, /about-us, /services", "Only NABCEP PV Design Specialists in El Paso County -> /, /about-us, /services", "COSSA Member -> /, /about-us, /services", "350+ projects installed and serviced -> /, /about-us, /services", "20+ years of experience -> /, /about-us, /services", "Equipment brands: Enphase, Silfab, Q. Cells, REC, IronRidge, S-5! -> /, /about-us, /services", "10-year workmanship warranty -> /, /about-us, /services", "Services: solar installation, repair, maintenance, replace