UPDATE companies SET description='Twinbrook Woodworks operates from Nokesville, Virginia, in the Northern Virginia region. The family-run business was established at Twinbrook Meadow, though a founding year is not publicly disclosed. The company emphasizes its roots in traditional craftsmanship and Christian values, aiming to create furniture that becomes the centerpiece of family gatherings.

The shop produces custom dining tables using quality hardwoods and durable construction methods. It also provides matching seating options, sourcing chairs and benches wholesale and applying custom stains or paints to coordinate with each table. Finishing services cover a range of stains, painted finishes, and weathered rustic looks. Every piece is made to order with custom sizing and design adjustments to fit spaces from breakfast nooks to large entertaining areas.

The company serves residential customers seeking heirloom-quality dining sets. Its tables and seating are designed for homeowners furnishing dining rooms, kitchen nooks, or gathering spaces, with style options spanning farmhouse, modern, and classic aesthetics.

Twinbrook Woodworks distinguishes itself by blending traditional woodworking techniques with a values-driven approach, stating that its pieces are designed to inspire warm family gatherings and create lasting memories for generations. The emphasis on custom fit and coordinated finishing is presented as a core differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom dining table manufacturing", "Seating finishing and customization", "Custom staining", "Custom painting", "Custom design and sizing"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Custom woodworking", "Home furnishings"], "materials": ["Hardwoods"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-run operation guided by Christian values", "Custom sizing and design for any space", "Matching seating finished to complement each table", "Range of stain, paint, and weathered rustic finishes", "Construction with quality hardwoods and durable methods"], "facts_used": ["Location: Nokesville, Virginia -> /", "Family-run ownership -> /", "Specializes in custom dining table sets -> /", "Christian values emphasis -> /", "Custom dining tables with quality hardwoods -> /services", "Matching seating sourced wholesale and custom finished -> /services", "Custom staining and painting finishes -> /services", "Custom sizing and design options -> /services", "Farmhouse, modern, classic styles -> /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "our family-run woodworking business specializes in crafting high-quality dining table sets", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='twinbrook-woodworks' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Twisted Apparel Co. is a family-owned and operated apparel shop based in Belle Fourche, South Dakota.

The shop provides a full suite of customization processes under one roof, including screen printing, embroidery, laser engraving, UV printing, Aqua Fusion (direct-to-film printing), sublimation, and 3D printing. These capabilities allow the team to handle projects ranging from custom apparel and team gear to promotional items, drinkware, awards, and signage without outsourcing any production steps.

Twisted Apparel Co. primarily serves businesses and sports teams looking for branded merchandise and uniforms. The company also works with a network of wholesale suppliers such as SanMar, Storm Creek, S&S Activewear, Momentec Brands, JDS Industries, Richardson, and Wyld Gear to source blank goods for decoration.

