UPDATE companies SET description='USA Wire & Cable, Inc. was founded in 1990 in Austin, Texas, by Joe Navarro, who remains president. The privately held company began as a distributor of specialty industrial wire and cable and has grown into a global supplier serving all 50 states and more than 50 countries.

The company distributes a broad range of electrical wire and cable products, including instrumentation, thermocouple, control, tray cable, portable power, medium voltage, armored cable, single conductor, and substation cable. Operations are centered at a corporate office and main distribution warehouse in Central Texas, with additional distribution centers in Texas and cable management staging locations coast to coast, enabling delivery to any U.S. job site within 48 hours.

USA Wire & Cable serves utilities, mining, construction, manufacturing, defense, government, oil and gas, and education sectors. Its specification review service is relied upon by top engineering and construction firms worldwide, and the company has supplied over 100 power plant projects.

