UPDATE companies SET description='United Wire Company operates from North Haven, Connecticut, as a family-owned manufacturer specializing in precision shaped wire. The company focuses exclusively on producing flat, square, and custom profile wire for a range of industrial applications.

The company custom manufactures wire to customer specifications, offering in-house tooling design and cutting at no charge. Its capabilities include strand and batch annealing with inert gas, heat treating, and packaging options such as spools up to 1,000 pounds and oscillated coils up to 1,000 pounds. United Wire works with a variety of alloys including stainless steel, carbon alloys, copper alloys, cobalt alloys, nickel alloys, and aluminum. It can supply continuous annealed lengths of 1,000 pounds without welds.

United Wire serves industries such as medical, spring making, telecommunications, metal stamping, aerospace, and oil and gas. Its customers include manufacturers requiring custom wire profiles for applications ranging from medical devices to well screens.

The company differentiates itself with a "Big Mill Capability, with a Personalized Approach," positioning itself as a one-stop shop for custom tooling, heat treating, and packaging. It emphasizes that precision shaped wire is its only business, and it holds ISO 9001:2015 certification while utilizing NADCAP-approved labs for testing.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','NADCAP approved labs']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom profile wire manufacturing", "Custom tooling design and fabrication", "Strand annealing", "Batch annealing", "Inert gas annealing", "Heat treating", "Spool packaging (up to 1,000 lbs)", "Oscillated coil packaging (up to 1,000 lbs)", "Wire shaping (flat, square, profile)", "Material selection consulting", "Quality inspection (ISO 9001:2015, NADCAP labs)"], "industries": ["Medical", "Spring making", "Telecommunications", "Metal stamping", "Aerospace", "Oil and gas"], "materials": ["Stainless Steel", "Carbon Alloys", "Copper Alloys", "Cobalt Alloys", "Nickel Alloys", "Aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Big Mill Capability, with a Personalized Approach", "Custom tooling designed and cut in-house at no charge", "Strand and batch annealing with inert gas capability", "1,000 lb continuous annealed lengths with no welds", "ISO 9001:2015 certified with NADCAP approved labs"], "facts_used": ["Company name: United Wire Company -> db", "Headquarters: North Haven, Connecticut -> db", "Family-owned business -> /", "Custom manufactures flat, square, and profile shaped wire -> /capabilities", "Custom tooling designed and cut in-house at no charge -> /capabilities", "Strand and batch annealing with inert gas -> /capabilities", "1,000 lb continuous annealed lengths with no welds -> /capabilities", "Alloys: Stainless Steel, Carbon Alloys, Copper Alloys, Cobalt Alloys, Nickel Alloys, Aluminum -> /capabilities", "Packaging: Spools up to 1,000 lbs, Oscillated coils up to 1,000 lbs -> /capabilities